Installed-Size: @TAMANHO@
Depends: libwebkitgtk-6.0-4 (>= 2.42), libjavascriptcoregtk-6.0-1, libgtk-4-1 (>= 4.14), libglib2.0-0t64 | libglib2.0-0, libxkbcommon0, libudev1, gstreamer1.0-plugins-good, gstreamer1.0-plugins-bad, gstreamer1.0-libav
Recommends: wl-clipboard, curl, gnome-keyring | kwalletmanager | keepassxc, gstreamer1.0-pipewire, hunspell-pt-br | hunspell-en-us
Provides: glove-web, www-browser
Conflicts: glove-web
Replaces: glove-web
Section: web
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/fabioaacarneiro/jangada
Description: Jangada, the Glove OS web browser (WebKitGTK engine)
 The browser of the Glove desktop: the system WebKitGTK engine (kept up to date with
 the distribution's security updates) with Glove's own window, tabs, address bar and
 pages (start page, errors), in the classic or the modern look. The GPU draws the
 pages; video codecs come from GStreamer (H.264 included). Ad and tracker shields,
 private windows, passwords in the system keyring, extensions.
